<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεξ-εργάζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>effect besides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕν δ ἐπεξειργάσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.140
				</span></i>
			; <i>accomplish,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλὴ μὲν ἄρχει, χεὶρ δ᾽ ἐ.</span>
			Ion Trag.<i><span class="en">
				63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>slay over again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλωλότ᾽ ἄνδρ᾽ ἐπεξειργάσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1288
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>work anew,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>investigate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν αἰτίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					82.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				122.7
			</span></i>.</div>
